         <widget class="QLabel" name="label_yngvi_x3d_desc">
          <property name="text">
           <string>Hardware-level performance engine with safe 2-tier architecture:
• Tier 1 (Universal): Dynamic VRAM Auto-Budgeting (77% heap limit), Selective Overlay Filter (disables NVIDIA overlay/filters while preserving RTSS), and runtime AVX-512 / AVX2 DMA scan. Safe on ALL CPUs &amp; GPUs!
• Tier 2 (Ryzen X3D Only): Dedicated GPUFront/GPUBack Core Pinning &amp; 3D V-Cache Zero-Sleep Futex (32k spins). Safely auto-bypassed on Intel and non-X3D CPUs with zero core starvation.
(Note: Restart Yngchii-X3D after toggling to apply all CPU affinity and Vulkan changes).</string>
          </property>
